1
00:00:03,420 --> 00:00:04,920
(Penny:)Okay, Baby-Doll Pink...

2
00:00:05,088 --> 00:00:08,628
(Penny:)...let's see if you can cover up the fact
that I got my dad's feet.

3
00:00:09,259 --> 00:00:10,679
LEONARD:
It's two degrees, Sheldon.

4
00:00:10,844 --> 00:00:12,844
I just wanna turn up
the thermostat two degrees.

5
00:00:13,013 --> 00:00:15,893
SHELDON: Let me point out
that two degrees can be the difference...

6
00:00:16,057 --> 00:00:17,097
...between water and steam.

7
00:00:17,267 --> 00:00:19,147
LEONARD:
Yes, if we were lived in a tea kettle.

8
00:00:19,310 --> 00:00:22,350
SHELDON: This is the temperature you
agreed to in the roommate agreement.

9
00:00:22,522 --> 00:00:24,022
LEONARD:
Screw the roommate agreement.

10
00:00:24,190 --> 00:00:26,280
SHELDON: No, you don't screw
the roommate agreement...

11
00:00:26,443 --> 00:00:29,113
...the roommate agreement screws you.

12
00:00:30,196 --> 00:00:32,536
LEONARD: You know what,
go to hell and set their thermostat.

13
00:00:32,699 --> 00:00:37,619
SHELDON: I don't have to go to hell.
At 73 degrees, I'm there already.

14
00:00:38,913 --> 00:00:40,453
[KNOCKING ON DOOR]

15
00:00:40,623 --> 00:00:42,413
(Penny(after a knock on the door):)Who is it?

16
00:00:43,293 --> 00:00:45,753
LEONARD: Leonard.
-Hang on.

17
00:00:51,217 --> 00:00:53,137
(Leonard:)Can I sleep on your couch tonight?

18
00:00:53,303 --> 00:00:56,593
(Penny:)You can try, but the people
across the hall are being very noisy.

19
00:00:57,766 --> 00:00:58,806
(Leonard:)You heard that, huh?

20
00:00:58,975 --> 00:01:01,685
(Penny:)Apparently, the one fella
tried to adjust the thermostat...

